    "id": "66bf975ba11b",
    "cat": "chip",
    "title_en": "Anthropic surpasses biggest rival OpenAI in secondary market valuation — surges to $1 trillion amid frantic investor interest",
    "title_zh": "Anthropic 在二手市場估值上超越最大競爭對手 OpenAI — 在投資者瘋狂追捧下，估值飆升至 1 兆美元",
    "title_zcn": "Anthropic在二级市场估值上超越最大竞争对手OpenAI——在投资者狂热追捧下估值飙升至1万亿美元",
    "title_ja": "Anthropic、二次市場での企業価値で最大のライバルであるOpenAIを上回る――投資家の熱狂的な関心を背景に1兆ドルまで急騰",
    "title_ko": "앤트로픽, 2차 시장 가치 평가에서 최대 경쟁사 오픈AI를 제치다 — 투자자들의 열띤 관심 속에 기업 가치가 1조 달러로 급등",
    "s_en": "Anthropic’s secondary market valuation has reportedly surged to $1 trillion, surpassing OpenAI’s $880 billion, driven by intense investor demand for AI exposure, and highlighting speculative pricing i",
    "s_zh": "據報導，受投資者對人工智慧領域投資機會的強烈需求驅動，Anthropic 的二手市場估值已飆升至 1 兆美元，超越 OpenAI 的 8,800 億美元，這凸顯了市場中存在投機性定價",
    "s_zcn": "据报道，受投资者对人工智能领域投资机会的强烈需求推动，Anthropic的二级市场估值已飙升至1万亿美元，超过了OpenAI的8800亿美元，这凸显了市场定价中的投机性。",
    "s_ja": "報道によると、AI分野への投資を求める投資家の強い需要に後押しされ、Anthropicのセカンダリー市場での評価額は1兆ドルに急騰し、OpenAIの8,800億ドルを上回った。これは投機的な価格設定を浮き彫りにしている。",
    "s_ko": "보도에 따르면, AI 투자에 대한 투자자들의 뜨거운 수요에 힘입어 앤트로픽(Anthropic)의 2차 시장 기업 가치가 1조 달러로 급등하며 오픈AI(OpenAI)의 8,800억 달러를 넘어섰으며, 이는 투기적인 가격 책정을 여실히 보여주고 있다.",
    "so": "tomshardware.com",
    "url": "https://www.tomshardware.com/tech-industry/artificial-intelligence/anthropic-surpasses-biggest-rival-openai-in-secondary-market-valuation-surges-to-usd1-trillion-amid-frantic-investor-interest",
    "time": "2026-04-23T15:11:30+00:00",
    "rank": 1776957090.0,
    "content": "According to a\nBusiness Insider\nreport today, Anthropic — the company behind Claude AI — has surged to a one-trillion-dollar valuation on private secondary trading market Forge Global, surpassing competitor OpenAI’s $880 billion valuation in the same markets. The surge highlights a steep uptick in investor demand for exposure to artificial intelligence, but what do these figures really mean, and what exactly is driving this spike?\nBecause neither Anthropic nor OpenAI is publicly listed, most investors cannot access shares through traditional stock exchanges. Instead, trades occur on secondary marketplaces, where early employees or investors can sell portions of their holdings.\nThese markets behave very differently from public equities: Supply is limited, as few insiders are willing to sell; pricing is based on individual deals, making transactions opaque; and valuations are controlled by a small handful of very powerful investors.\nArticle continues below\n(Image credit: Shutterstock)\nAnthropic's actual valuation is anchored in its latest round of funding in February 2026, in which the company received a consensus $380 billion post-money valuation following due diligence and structured negotiations with institutional investors.\nHowever, the $1 trillion secondary market valuation reflects what people without access are willing to pay for a slice of Anthropic. Business Insider reports that, according to Ken Sawyer, cofounder and managing partner at Saints Capital, a venture secondary firm, an Anthropic shareholder recently offered to unload shares at a $1.15 trillion valuation.\nAs unbelievable as that sounds, it appears people are willing to pay. In an\nX post\nthis week, Jesse Leimgruber, founder of OpenHome, claimed that a \"very well-known growth fund\" offered to buy Anthropic shares at a $1.05 trillion valuation.\nIt gets crazier. In a\nLinkedIn post\n, one investor offered their 14-acre estate in exchange for Anthropic shares at a valuation of over $800 billion, more than twice the actual value.\nGet Tom's Hardware's best news and in-depth reviews, straight to your inbox.\n\"It's been an epic run for Anthropic,\" Glen Anderson, CEO of Rainmaker Securities, told Business Insider. \"Everybody wants to be part of a generational opportunity in AI, and right now, Anthropic is in the pole position.\"\nThe company said it had fielded numerous offers from VCs, with one offer coming in at a $960 billion valuation, a price Anderson said would have been unthinkable even a few weeks ago. Still, he expects it to be snapped up by someone else.\nThose who currently own Anthropic shares also report being inundated with numerous offers.\n\"We receive daily offers from the ridiculous to the sublime,\" Bradley Horowitz, a general partner at an early investor in both Anthropic and OpenAI, told Business Insider. \"I barely open those emails because we're not interested. We are playing a long game.\"\nInterestingly, this surge may be more about Anthropic than about AI fever in general,...",
    "content_source": "full"
  },
  {
    "id": "fa75f440dda0",
    "cat": "finance",
    "title_en": "US-Kuwaiti journalist held in Kuwait over social media posts acquitted, lawyers say",
    "title_zh": "律師表示，因社群媒體貼文而在科威特遭拘留的美籍科威特記者已獲判無罪",
    "title_zcn": "据律师称，因社交媒体帖子在科威特被拘留的美籍科威特记者已被判无罪",
    "title_ja": "ソーシャルメディアへの投稿をめぐりクウェートで拘束されていた米・クウェート系ジャーナリストが無罪となったと、弁護団が明らかにした",
    "title_ko": "변호인 측에 따르면, 소셜 미디어 게시물 문제로 쿠웨이트에 구금됐던 미국-쿠웨이트 이중국적 기자가 무죄 판결을 받았다",
    "s_en": "Ahmed Shihab-Eldin reportedly faced charges, including spreading false information, after he re-posted images related to the Iran war.",
    "s_zh": "據報導，艾哈邁德·希哈布·埃爾丁因轉發與伊朗戰爭相關的圖片，面臨包括散布虛假資訊在內的指控。",
    "s_zcn": "据报道，艾哈迈德·希哈布·埃尔丁因转发与伊朗战争相关的图片，面临包括散布虚假信息在内的多项指控。",
    "s_ja": "報道によると、アフメド・シハブ・エルディン氏は、イラン戦争に関連する画像を再投稿したことを受け、虚偽情報の流布などの容疑で告発されたという。",
    "s_ko": "아흐메드 시하브 엘딘은 이란 전쟁과 관련된 이미지를 재게시한 뒤 허위 정보 유포 등의 혐의를 받은 것으로 알려졌다.",
    "so": "bbc.com",
    "url": "https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cy81ljrd445o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
    "time": "2026-04-23T15:11:03+00:00",
    "rank": 1776957063.0,
    "content": "\"We are relieved that, after 52 days in detention, Ahmed has been found innocent on all charges. Our focus now is upon ensuring the liberty and safety of our client, and we will provide more details once they can be confirmed,\" Gallagher added.",
    "content_source": "full"
  },
  {
    "id": "b0228b9690a8",
    "cat": "finance",
    "title_en": "After Cesar Chavez’s Fall, What to Do With the Art That Honored Him?",
    "title_zh": "塞薩爾·查維茲雕像被推倒後，該如何處理那些為他立的雕像？",
    "title_zcn": "塞萨尔·查韦斯雕像被推倒后，那些纪念他的艺术品该何去何从？",
    "title_ja": "セサール・チャベスの死後、彼を称えた芸術作品をどうすべきか？",
    "title_ko": "세자르 차베스의 타계 이후, 그를 기렸던 예술 작품들은 어떻게 해야 할까?",
    "s_en": "Artists who created public depictions of the civil rights icon Cesar Chavez have had to revisit their works after accusations emerged of Mr. Chavez’s sexual abuse of girls in the movement.",
    "s_zh": "隨著有關民權運動象徵人物塞薩爾·查維茲（Cesar Chavez）涉嫌性侵運動中少女的指控浮出水面，曾創作過查維茲公共肖像的藝術家們不得不重新審視自己的作品。",
    "s_zcn": "一些曾创作过民权运动标志性人物塞萨尔·查韦斯公共肖像的艺术家，在查韦斯被指控对运动中的女孩实施性虐待后，不得不重新审视自己的作品。",
    "s_ja": "公民権運動の象徴であるセサール・チャベス氏を描いた芸術家たちは、同氏が運動に関わっていた少女たちに対して性的虐待を行っていたとの告発が浮上したことを受け、自らの作品を見直すことを余儀なくされている。",
    "s_ko": "민권 운동의 상징인 세자르 차베스를 주제로 한 공공 예술 작품을 제작한 예술가들은, 차베스 씨가 운동에 참여했던 소녀들을 성추행했다는 의혹이 제기되자 자신의 작품을 재검토해야 하는 상황에 처했다.",
    "so": "nytimes.com",
    "url": "https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/23/us/cesar-chavez-art-changes.html",
    "time": "2026-04-23T15:09:54+00:00",
    "rank": 1776956994.0,
    "content": "Artists who created public depictions of the civil rights icon Cesar Chavez have had to revisit their works after accusations emerged of Mr. Chavez’s sexual abuse of girls in the movement.",
    "content_source": "rss"
  },
